  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides advisory and financial support to Ministry of Transport. It has a focus on providing support for policy reform that will drive innovation and engage Australian expertise in areas like road safety, engineering methods and project finance. The investment works closely with Mutilateral Development Banks and with the private sector in improving transport infrastructure.</narrative>
